@server = http://localhost:4004
### Setup DB vectors
POST {{server}}/setup

### 1. Ingest: embed all documents -> returns number embedded
POST {{server}}/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Retrieve only: look at the scores
GET {{server}}/search?q=my account is locked

### 3. Grounded answer
POST {{server}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How long does a new laptop take?" }

### 4. Out-of-scope question -> should NOT hallucinate
POST {{server}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How is the weather today?" }
